{"strongs": "H4784", "word": "מָרָה", "translit": "ma.rah", "root": "מרה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be contentious, refractory, rebellious", "definition": "מָרָה verb be contentious, refractory, rebellious (Late Hebrew id. , Hiph`il; Arabic III. dispute with ; Syriac Pa`el contend with ); — Qal. Perfect 3 masculine singular מָרָה 1Kgs 13:26 feminine מָֽרְתָה Hos 14:1 מָרָ֑תָה Jer 4:17 2 masculine singular מָרִיתָ 1Kgs 13:21 + 11 t. perfect; Infinitive absolute מָרוֺ Lam 1:20 Participle מֹרֶה 2Kgs 14:26 (but read מר , √ מרר , Kmp Kau כִּי מַר הוּא ); מוֺרֶה Deut 21:18 + 3 t.; feminine מֹרְאָה Zeph 3:1 (read מֹרָה ; metaplastic form according to Ges «GKC:75»§ 75 R. 22); plural מֹרִים Num 20:10 — be disobedient, rebellious: 1. בֵּן סוֺרֵר וּמֹרֶה Deut 21:18 ; Deut 21:20 stubborn and rebellious son (towards father). 2. elsewhere towards God: דֹּר סוֺרֵר וּמֹרֶה Ps 78:8 ׳ לֵב סורר ומ Jer 5:23 מוֺרְאָה ונגאלה הָעִיר Zeph 3:1 הַמֹּרִים Num 20:10 ye rebels ( P ); absolute Isa 50:5 ; Isa 63:10 ; Lam 1:20 (twice in verse); || מאן Isa 1:20 פשׁע Lam 3:42 with בְּ person Hos 14:1 ; Ps 5:11 , elsewhere accusative of person Jer 4:17 ׳ י 's words Ps 105:28 מרה (את) פי Num 20:24 ; Num 27:14 ( P ), 1Sam 12:15 ; 1Kgs 13:21 ; 1Kgs 13:26 ( D 2 ) Lam 1:18 . — In Hos 4:4 read perhaps מָרוּ בִי have rebelled against me (for ᵑ0 כִּמְרִיבֵי ), so RS Proph. iv. n. 8 Che (for other views see ריב ). Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine plural הִמְרוּ Ps 106:33 ; Ps 107:11 Imperfect יַמְרֶה Josh 1:18 feminine וַתֶּ֫מֶר Ezek 5:6 2 masculine singular תַּמֵּר (as if √ מרר ) Exod 23:21 , read תֶּ֫מֶר Di and others; 3 masculine plural יַמְרוּ Ps 106:43 + 6 t; suffix יַמְרוּהוּ Ps 78:40 2 masculine plural תַּמְרוּ 1Sam 12:14 + 3 t.; Infinitive construct לַמְרוֺת Isa 3:8 ; Ps 78:17 suffix הַמְּרוֺתָם ( Ges «GKC:20»§ 20 . 2b) Job 17:2 Participle plural מַמְרִים Deut 9:7 + 2 t.; — shew disobedience, rebelliousness , always toward God: absolute Neh 9:26 . (|| מרד ), Ps 106:7 ; Ps 106:43 ; Job 17:2 with בְּ person Exod 23:21 ; Ezek 20:8 ; Ezek 20:13 ; Ezek 20:21 עִם Deut 9:7 ; Deut 9:24 ; Deut 31:27 elsewhere accusative of God or his commands: Isa 3:8 ; Ezek 5:6 ; Ps 78:17 ; Ps 78:40 ; Ps 78:56 ; Ps 107:11 המרה את פי Deut 1:26 ; Deut 1:43 ; Deut 9:23 ; Josh 1:18 ; 1Sam 12:14 ( D 2 ), אתרֿוחוֺ Ps 106:33 (compare Ephr 4:30); perhaps Ps 139:20 (see אָמַר 1. ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4806')\">BDB4806</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4784')\">H4784</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H4754')\">H4754</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4805')\">BDB4805</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4807')\">BDB4807</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מָרָה</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be contentious, refractory, rebellious</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Hiph`il; Arabic <placeholder3078/> III. <highlight>dispute with</highlight>; Syriac <placeholder3079/> Pa`el <highlight>contend with</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal.</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>מָרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 13:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,13,26)\">1Kgs 13:26</ref> feminine <bdbheb>מָֽרְתָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 14:1\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,1)\">Hos 14:1</ref> <bdbheb>מָרָ֑תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 4:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,17)\">Jer 4:17</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>מָרִיתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 13:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,13,21)\">1Kgs 13:21</ref> + 11 t. perfect; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>מָרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 1:20\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,20)\">Lam 1:20</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מֹרֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:26\" b=\"12\"